# Assets excluded from the transfer Worker bundle (workers/transfer).
# The Worker only serves /transfer* routes; GitHub Pages serves the rest of
# the site, so these entries are never fetched through env.ASSETS. Excluding
# them keeps every uploaded asset within Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-file limit
# (node_modules ships a >100 MiB workerd binary; the file below is ~26 MiB).
.git
.wrangler
node_modules
kek-mca/3D/tunnel/tracks_by_depth.json
